<title>HONG KONG: ABC year profit rises 124.61 percent.</title>
<headline>ABC year profit rises 124.61 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   52.0	  vs 23.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	   vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  129.47 gain vs 5.78 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    207.95	vs 92.58</p>
<p>    Turnover		     326.24	vs 358.37</p>
<p>    Company name		 ABC Communications (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 21-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 30</p>
<p>NOTE - ABC Communications is a paging operator.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$148.14 million on disposal of investment in an associated company upon its initial public offering of shares, loss of HK$13.87 million on provision for diminution in value of an associated company and loss of HK$4.8 million on write-off of fixed assets due to fire accident.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is three H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs six cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
